.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBMediaCard\fR: an album, an artist, a playlist, an app: a picture, a title and a subtitle, drawn as a \fBcard\fR or, in compact mode, as a tight row. One pattern in two densities, so a grid of cards and a list of rows are the same data with one switch. (A long list with columns, a sort and a time is a \fBResponsiveTable\fR with \fBMode::Table\fR.)
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCard\fR: the picture centered over the title and the subtitle, the whole card pressable.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCompact\fR: the picture small at the start and the title over the subtitle beside it, a flat row (\fBflat_row\fR).
.PP
Put cards in a \fBCardGrid\fR; \fBCardGrid::compact(true)\fR lays the compact form out as a list.
.PP
.nf
.RS
CardGrid::new(albums.iter().map(|a| {
    MediaCard::new(&a.name)
        .subtitle(format!("{} \[u00B7] {}", a.artist, a.year))
        .picture(cover(a.id, if compact { 36.0 } else { 88.0 }))
        .compact(compact)
        .on_press(Msg::Open(a.id))
        .into()
}))
\&.compact(compact)
.RE
.fi
